.TH start-cli-server-host-binding-reassign-port 1  "reassign-port "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-host\-binding\-reassign\-port \- Change a binding\*(Aqs assigned external port
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server host binding reassign\-port\fR [\fB\-\-ssl\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINTERNAL_PORT\fR> <\fIEXTERNAL_PORT\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change a binding\*(Aqs assigned external port
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-ssl\fR
Reassign the SSL port instead of the non\-SSL port
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIINTERNAL_PORT\fR>
Internal port number
.TP
<\fIEXTERNAL_PORT\fR>
Port number
